[TITLE]
; FloodOps SYNTHETIC 3-zone demo site package (Taman Kyra layout). Not a real location and not a real drainage network:
; coordinates are illustrative projected metres. The network is a modified copy of Tay Zheheng's illustrative SWMM model
; (models/illustrative_taman_kyra/baseline.inp) with three problem zones: A trunk PIPE-P02, B series PIPE-P04 + PIPE-P09,
; C low street NODE-J07 with a small grate.
